OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery suspends routine
OL,4,Aappointments due to 'tsunami' of demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GP surgery has suspended all routine
OL,7,Fappointments due to what it calls a
OL,8,F"tsunami" of demand.
OL,10,FIt is the second time in a week that
OL,11,FAberfoyle Medical Practice in
OL,12,FLondonderry has told patients that it
OL,13,Fis not offering routine appointments -
OL,14,Feither in person or online.
OL,16,FDr Donna Mace, who is a partner at the
OL,17,Fpractice and also a member of the
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland General Practitioners'
OL,19,FCommittee, said the practice was
OL,20,Fcurrently dealing with unprecedented
OL,21,Fdemand.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
