OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery suspends routine
OL,4,Aappointments due to 'tsunami' of demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn real terms, that means their doctors
OL,7,Fare seeing around 60 patients a day,
OL,8,Fwhich she said was not safe.
